Contacts table important information:

From the small project powerpoint:
The minimum information each contact record needs is:
- Name (prefer First/Last Name)
- Email
- Phone
- Date record created

I added another section for user attribution to keep the contacts connected to the specific user that made them so that they can be easily shown to each user

This is the command used to create the contacts table:

CREATE TABLE Contacts (
 	FirstName varchar(50) Not Null,
 	LastName varchar(50) Not Null,
 	Email varchar(50),
 	Phone varchar(50),
 	DateCreated date Not Null,
	User Attribution varchar(50) Not Null
)

User table important information:
The Usernames are kept unique to prevent misattribution of created contacts

This is the command i used to create the users table:

CREATE TABLE Users (
Username varchar(50) PRIMARY KEY,
UserPassword varchar(50) Not Null
    )


